id: DRAFT-mapbox-geometry-2.0.3-catch1-signed-urng-libcxx-compat-fix
trigger_tool: conan|cmake|cxx
phase: building
error_signature: __libcpp_random_is_valid_urng<Catch::RandomNumberGenerator>|uniform_int_distribution\.h.*static_assert|shuffle\.h.*uniform_int_distribution
severity: 3
category: compat, libc, headers, testing, build-system, cmake, ohos
match_keywords: catch1, urng, libc++, static_assert, uniform_int_distribution
title: vendored Catch 1.x有符号URNG与新版libc++ uniform_int_distribution静态断言冲突的幂等兼容修复
root_cause: Catch 1.9.6 RandomNumberGenerator声明typedef std::ptrdiff_t result_type为有符号类型，新版OHOS LLVM libc++强制要求URNG result_type为无符号整数，std::shuffle内部uniform_int_distribution<long>对其做__libcpp_random_is_valid_urng有效性静态断言导致上游测试编译拦截
ffected_scope: vendored Catch 1.x且经std::shuffle或uniform_int_distribution使用Catch::RandomNumberGenerator作为URNG，在新版libc++工具链下编译上游测试的header-library类C++库
affected_scope: vendored Catch 1.x且经std::shuffle或uniform_int_distribution使用Catch::RandomNumberGenerator作为URNG，在新版libc++工具链下编译上游测试的header-library类C++库
verification_cmd: 真机preflight build()上游测试编译通过且HMBS门禁全部通过，原v2:compile:test_assertion_failed消失
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: idempotent-test-framework-urng-compat-patch
rec_description: 编译前对vendored catch.hpp做幂等兼容修复，将RandomNumberGenerator::result_type由有符号std::ptrdiff_t改为unsigned int，仅动测试框架头不动测试逻辑与断言
rec_command: conanfile.py: 导入replace_in_file，在_run_upstream_tests编译前替换typedef std::ptrdiff_t result_type为typedef unsigned int result_type
rec_auto_fix: true
rec_impl: conan-recipe-plus-test-package
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: upgrade-or-replace-test-framework
fallback_description: 若vendored Catch无法原地兼容，则升级到Catch2或替换测试框架并同步测试入口，保留原失败审计记录
fallback_auto_fix: false
forbid_1_pattern: typedef\s+std::ptrdiff_t\s+result_type
forbid_1_reason: 禁止保留有符号URNG定义放行，新libc++ uniform_int_distribution静态断言必定拦截编译
forbid_1_consequence: 真机build()上游测试编译失败，任务退回修复循环
similar_to: []
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-mapbox-geometry-2.0.3-catch1-signed-urng-libcxx-compat-fix.md
last_updated: 2026-09-16
source_event: mapbox-geometry/2.0.3真机预检上游测试编译被libc++ URNG静态断言拦截并修复为幂等无符号化兼容
authors: hmbs-executor
